      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "editorial-button",
      "description": "Contorno com preenchimento por pseudo-elemento; amostra da variante clara.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-editorial\">Explorar a coleção</button>",
      "css": ".ds-editorial{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;padding:.75rem 1.35rem;border:1px solid var(--cta-accent,#ef492b);border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--forest-950,#0b261d);font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;line-height:1.15;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 200ms ease-in-out,color 200ms ease-in-out;font-family:var(--font-primary,\"proxima-nova\",\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif);}.ds-editorial::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:var(--cta-accent,#ef492b);transform:translate(-100%,0) rotate(10deg);transition:transform 200ms ease-out}.ds-editorial:is(:hover,:focus-visible){border-color:transparent;color:var(--cta-on-accent,#06140f);transform:scale(1.05)}.ds-editorial:is(:hover,:focus-visible)::before{transform:translate(0,0)}.ds-editorial:focus-visible{outline:.2rem solid var(--cta-accent,#ef492b);outline-offset:.25rem;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-editorial,.ds-editorial::before{transition:none;transform:none}}"
    },
